# anki-agent Enhancement — 3 Prompt Errors, TTS Reversal, and Prompt Key Mismatch (2026-05-24)

## Critical Bugs Found in Current Prompt

### Bug 1: TTS Providers Completely Reversed
Current prompt says: "TTS: AWS Polly (Greek) + local say command (Spanish)"
Reality: AWS Polly = Spanish (Mia, es-MX, neural); Google Cloud TTS = Greek (Chirp3-HD)
No `say` command is used anywhere. This would cause an agent to use the wrong TTS for each language.

### Bug 2: Wrong Data Consumer (bible-tools vs enrich.py)
Current prompt says: "koine-anki/data/ is referenced by bible-tools ingest_local.py"
Reality: koine-pimsleur/src/enrich.py consumes koine-anki/data/ via KOINE_ANKI_PATH env var.
No bible-tools dependency exists in this project.

### Bug 3: Wrong Source Data File Path
Current prompt says: "data/matthew_compounds.json"
Reality: koine-anki/data/matthew/compounds_enriched.json (subdirectory + different name)

## Validator Trap: Wrong JSON Key
c4-docs validator reported "prompt not found, ~1159 chars estimated" because it looked for systemPrompt key.
Actual key is prompt. Actual length: 2,455 chars.
Always check both prompt and systemPrompt keys when reading agent JSON configs.

## TTS Fallback Correction
Notes said: "Wavenet-B fallback for short words (<400ms)"
Reality: Fallback is other Chirp3-HD voices (FALLBACK_M/FALLBACK_F pools). Threshold is char count <4, not duration.
The notes described a superseded implementation. Code is always authoritative over notes.

## Data Verification Results
- Strong's entries: 5,624 (not 5,516 as internet research claimed)
- MorphGNT columns: 7 (not 6) — format: ref | POS | morph-code | text | text2 | normalized | lemma
- Stable model IDs: Pimsleur=1646410900000, Compounds=1646410861305, Terminaciones=1607392319

## Project Structure
- koine-anki/: Active Anki deck generation (compounds pipeline + terminaciones)
- koine-pimsleur/: Active Pimsleur audio course (90 lessons, 16.7 hours)
- anki-main/languages/: FROZEN original monorepo (Apr 6)
- 5 scripts byte-identical between anki-main and koine-anki; generate_deck.py diverged (koine-anki newer)
- 4 new scripts in koine-anki not in anki-main: enrich_cognates.py, audit_cognates.py, enrich_verses.py, add_rvr60.py

## Critical Rules for anki-agent
1. Greek text: always NFC normalize (unicodedata.normalize('NFC', text))
2. Stable deck IDs: never change hardcoded model/deck IDs
3. compounds_registry.json: dedup before processing new NT books (290 Matthew entries)
4. Vocabulary blacklist: neros->hudor, spiti->oikos, psomi->artos, porta->thyra (post-1453 loanwords banned)
5. TTS: Polly=Spanish, Google TTS=Greek
6. KOINE_ANKI_PATH: set when koine-pimsleur is not a sibling of koine-anki
7. All explanations in Spanish; simplified terminology
EOF
